WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:00.470 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  in the aftermath of the slap that rocked  the oscars could will smith actually  lose his best actor award does the  academy have a process for that keep  watching for the answers the 94th  academy awards won't be remembered as  the year kota won best picture or dune  nearly swept the technical awards the  entire ceremony has been overshadowed by  will smith's response to a chris rock  joke about jada pink and smith's  alopecia when the comedian took the  stage to present the award for best  documentary feature while smith appeared  to initially laugh at rock's joke a  throwaway quip comparing piket smith's  short hairstyle to demi moore's  character in the 1997 film gi jane the  knight's eventual best actor winner then  stood up approached rock on stage and  slapped him in the face it was censored  in the us broadcast but videos of the  international feed of the show proved  that rock noted will smith just slap the  [ __ ] out of me to which smith replied  twice keep my wife's name out of your  mouth a bewildered dolby theater  audience realized they weren't watching  some bizarre sketch smith did in fact  genuinely slap rock who proceeded to  plead his case that it was just a joke  about g.i jane before awkwardly  transitioning back to handing out the  best documentary feature award which  went to summer of soul the unprecedented  altercation loomed large over the rest  of the ceremony smith took the stage a  second time later that night to accept  the award for best actor in his surreal  tear-filled speech smith compared his  action to those of richard williams who  he portrays in the film for which he won  king richard this prompted questions  about whether he should even be allowed  to keep the award you're looking at this  going okay academy so what are you going  to do about it what are you gonna do  about this because clearly there were no  consequences that night the new york  post sarah nathan reported that industry  insiders are suggesting that smith may  be asked to give his oscar back people  magazine reported that behind the scenes  abc and academy representatives  scrambled to understand what happened  and that removing smith from the show  was seriously discussed however  uncomfortable the altercation was  members of the academy present at the  dolby theater appeared to attempt to  ease tension as social media erupted in  response cameras showed both will smith  and jada pinkett smith laughing from  their seats as sean p diddy combs told  the audience that smith and rock would  solve that like family at an after party  after the ceremony ended the academy  tweeted the academy does not condone  violence of any form the post noted that  the organization took great pains to  create standards of conduct for academy  members in 2017. according to variety  this code states in addition to  achieving excellence in the field of  motion picture arts and sciences members  must also behave ethically by upholding  the academy's values of respect for  human dignity inclusion and a supportive  environment that fosters creativity  there is no place in the academy for  people who abuse their status power or  influence in a manner that violates  recognized standards of decency but even  with the code of conduct there does not  appear to be a formal process for  stripping academy members of an award  luckily it does appear the conflict was  largely resolved in the aftermath of the  shocking oscars moment according to nbc  news los angeles police said in a  statement that rock declined to press  charges page six likewise reported that  combs confirmed rock and smith made  amends after the ceremony variety  reported that smith answered a question  about how he was doing with it's all  love the day after the ceremony march 28  2022 smith issued a direct apology to  rock on instagram he wrote in part i  would like to publicly apologize to you  chris i was out of line and i was wrong  i'm embarrassed and my actions were not  indicative of the man i want to be the  smith family has been in the news  frequently throughout this awards season  jada pinkett smith posted on instagram  in december 2021 that she shaved her  head due to hair loss from her alopecia  and will smith spoke candidly about  their at times non-monogamous marriage  and a november 2021 gq feature the road  don't look like everybody thinks it's  supposed to look but you know don't try  this at home children  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite celebrities are coming  soon subscribe to our youtube channel  and hit the bell so you don't miss a  single one  [Music]

